cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Digicities ontology in published work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Digicities Ontology"
abstract: >-
  Digicities is a requirements-driven semantic layer that connects models to the
  data they need: each model states its inputs as requirements against a shared
  ontology, and the platform finds, checks and delivers that data from a knowledge
  graph. This is that shared ontology (OWL/RDF).
authors:
  - family-names: Allan
    given-names: James
version: 0.6.0
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/uesl-empa/digicities-ontology"
keywords:
  - ontology
  - OWL
  - RDF
  - semantic layer
  - energy systems
